        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Fatigue"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "For the last few days, more tired and needing more rests; still doing some activities around the house and yard."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-2",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Oral intake"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Eating a bit less, but still having 2–3 small feeds."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-3",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-3",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Abdominal distension and tightness"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Abdomen still big from fluid; possibly a touch tighter than last month, though patient is unsure. Describes abdomen as tight but not really painful. No sudden large increase in girth or severe abdominal pain."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-4",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-4",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Ankle swelling"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Ankles are about the same as usual."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-5",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-5",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Urine output"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient feels he may be urinating less, especially in the mornings, but is not measuring output and is definitely not anuric."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-6",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
